{"type":"turn_start"}
{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Translation reference annotation\n\nReview every supplied item in its given order. Compare the source and target, using bounded_fixed_context only as evidence for meaning, placeholders, runtime behavior, speaker intent, and register. Do not infer facts that the supplied fields do not support.\n\nAssign exactly one label to every item:\n\n- CLEAN: the target has no material translation defect supported by the supplied evidence.\n- SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT: a material defect is visible from source and target without relying on bounded context.\n- CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT: a material defect is established only with the bounded context.\n- UNRESOLVED: the supplied evidence is insufficient for a determinate label.\n\nFor every item, provide a concise evidence statement. A defect label requires one or more bounded defect atoms. Each atom must state its kind, claim, and supporting evidence. For CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT, source_evidence_sha256s must cite the supplied source_evidence[].sha256 for that same item; do not calculate, invent, substitute, or cite any other hash. Each source_evidence text is byte-equal to the corresponding item's bounded_fixed_context, and its lowercase SHA-256 is over the exact UTF-8 bytes of text. CLEAN must have no defect atoms, source-evidence hashes, or limitations. Surface-visible defects must have no source-evidence hashes or limitations. Context-dependent defects must have no limitations. UNRESOLVED must state a non-empty limitation.\n\nReturn exactly one JSON document conforming to the supplied response schema. Take response schema_version, status, parent_queue_sha256, and shard_file_sha256 from the response schema consts. Take shard_id, item_count, item_ids, and item order from the shard. Do not add fields or prose outside the JSON document.\n\nINPUT JSON:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"route-familiarity-reference-collection-shard-v1\",\n  \"status\": \"FROZEN_ZERO_INFERENCE_UNPOPULATED\",\n  \"parent_queue_sha256\": \"620b736996ac254c43b3c721cdbfca20f7e68d8f553b7fe21b9effa0c025b3d2\",\n  \"shard_id\": \"SHARD-02\",\n  \"item_count\": 29,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0032\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"We only wanted to help the ogres, you know, and they seem more willing to cooperate now\",\n      \"target\": \"我们只是想帮助食人魔\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'We only wanted to help the ogres' - not 'the ogre you know'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0033\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"though this should have made me strongly fear for my own safety\",\n      \"target\": \"尽管这本应让我强烈担心自身安危\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"fear for one's own safety, not 'strong fear for one's happiness'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0034\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I felt a strange sensation that coursed through every fiber of my being as the dwarf died by my own hand\",\n      \"target\": \"我感到一种奇怪的感觉，这种感觉随着矮人死于这一击而贯穿我的每一根纤维\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"old invented a 'wail passing through my body' not in source; corrected to the feeling of the dwarf's death passing through her\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0035\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"sparing you was my mistake\",\n      \"target\": \"放过我是我的错误\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'sparing you was my mistake' - not 'forgiving you was my mistake'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0036\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I struck the halfling in the back\",\n      \"target\": \"我立刻击中了半身人的后背\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"struck the halfling's back, not a vague 'counterattacked'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0037\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the ogre turning the spit\",\n      \"target\": \"负责转动烤肉叉的食人魔\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the ogre was turning the roasting spit, not spitting\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0038\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"a cellar that had not been touched since the original shaloren residents had lived here\",\n      \"target\": \"自原先的永恒精灵居民居住于此以来一直未被触动\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the cellar had been untouched since the original shaloren residents lived there\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0039\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"foolhardy witch\",\n      \"target\": \"鲁莽的女巫\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'foolhardy' = reckless, not 'brave'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0040\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"also the worst conversationalist I have ever met\",\n      \"target\": \"也是我见过的最不会聊天的人\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"worst at conversation, a negative quality, not 'worst talker' misread as brave/positive\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0041\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"of the questions she posed to me\",\n      \"target\": \"在她提出的这些问题中\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the questions were asked by the young mage (her), not the narrator (me)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0042\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I see you are doing alright, you're certainly quite tough thalore\",\n      \"target\": \"我看你恢复得不错，你确实很坚强\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'I see you are doing alright' is about physical recovery from injury, not general conduct\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0043\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"which only annoyed me, wishing she was further away\",\n      \"target\": \"希望她离我更远些\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'wished she was further away' - distance, not 'walk a bit more'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0044\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"but you don't seem to have much combat experience\",\n      \"target\": \"而且你看起来也没什么战斗经验\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the source only states Fay lacks combat experience, with no comparison to the witch\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0045\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"The words burst from my mouth before I could stop them\",\n      \"target\": \"这句话很快就从我口中脱口而出\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the words burst out of her mouth, not 'vanished from her mind'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0046\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"we perhaps led you to your own [imprisonment]\",\n      \"target\": \"我们获准解除监禁时，却可能把你带进了属于你的监禁之中\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source (with a grammatical typo in the original) means the ogres, once freed, may have inadvertently led Fay into her own confinement (consistent with her being bedridden for months) - not 'bring you to your own place'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0047\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"two officials of Elvala and a cadre of guards\",\n      \"target\": \"两名埃尔瓦拉的官员和一队卫兵\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a cadre of guards' is plural, not 'a guard'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0048\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"one of the bone giants stepped forward attempting to knock me down\",\n      \"target\": \"其中一个骨巨人走上前来，试图把我打倒\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source subject is singular ('one of the bone giants'), old made it plural giants trampling\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0049\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"as I attacked it, this bone giant would also rearrange its bones\",\n      \"target\": \"在我攻击它的时候，这个骨巨人也会移动它的骨骼来强化自己\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the bone giant is an undead construct, referred to as 'it', not 'she'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0050\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I slowly leaned in, kissing him again\",\n      \"target\": \"我慢慢俯身，再次亲吻他\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"leaning in to kiss, not crouching down\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0051\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"They possess no cultural identity or history to fall back on and sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground.\",\n      \"target\": \"他们没有文化认同，也没有可供依凭的历史，处在埃亚尔地表的文明种族与地下的恐魔之间。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground' - the Drem's own existential/categorical position, not their 'civilization's fate hanging' on a cliff\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0052\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"make there way towards the worms brain cluster and destroy it\",\n      \"target\": \"将某一个人传送到蠕虫的大脑里，然后摧毁它的脑簇\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'destroy it' refers to the worm's brain cluster specifically\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0053\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Entropy is a chaotic force that seeks to spread more chaos throughout the universe.\",\n      \"target\": \"熵是混乱的能量，它总是在宇宙间不断制造更多的混乱。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Entropy' as an energy is singular ('it'), not plural\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0054\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have read a tome depicting the first teachings of entropy magic\",\n      \"target\": \"你阅读了一本描述了熵魔法最初教诲的古书\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the first teachings of entropy magic' = teachings, not 'source'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0055\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Insanity is a measure of their own dementia and makes them more and more chaotic.\",\n      \"target\": \"疯狂值衡量着他们自身的痴狂程度，并使他们变得越来越混沌。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a measure of their own dementia' - specifically dementia, not vague 'psychological changes'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0056\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Long ago the mysterious machines that seem to be the source of dwarves malfunctioned\",\n      \"target\": \"那些似乎是矮人源头的神秘机器失灵了\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the mysterious machines' is plural\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0057\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Their wrath is so terrible they can stun their foes with any attacks\",\n      \"target\": \"他们的愤怒如此恐怖，任何攻击都能够震慑对手。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'stun their foes with any attacks' = attacks, not 'any damage'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0058\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have encountered the horror that came out of Kroltar, the mightiest wyrm, and vanquished it.\",\n      \"target\": \"你遇到了从最强大的巨龙库洛塔身上产生的恐魔，并击败了它。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the mightiest wyrm' = mightiest/strongest, not 'most terrifying'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0059\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you\",\n      \"target\": \"伸出黏滑的触手，将敌人拉向你\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you' - dropped 'slimy' and changed 'pull to you' into a directionless 'grab'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0060\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Will crumble to dust when read!\",\n      \"target\": \"这本书会在阅读后化为尘土！\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Will crumble to dust' = dust, not 'pieces/fragments'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0032\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0032\",\n      \"sha256\": \"ecfcd72d5a230761cfa9af8d26586296e0720ce5be98a8154b6ddc96655c6a5a\",\n      \"text\": \"'We only wanted to help the ogres' - not 'the ogre you know'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0033\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0033\",\n      \"sha256\": \"fae20350a5b4717ec2b6a9bdcc1bd716a17a3f1ff3e69a17577b4cd99ed96dea\",\n      \"text\": \"fear for one's own safety, not 'strong fear for one's happiness'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0034\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0034\",\n      \"sha256\": \"28ac84ef2065750c726d65c2f630e8e335c99dc6f8fe2c38256ab3a865f6fb7b\",\n      \"text\": \"old invented a 'wail passing through my body' not in source; corrected to the feeling of the dwarf's death passing through her\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0035\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0035\",\n      \"sha256\": \"7f7758ef7b16c878a1fad10293ca69ac0700d067e7558b6bef1d7bb24990078f\",\n      \"text\": \"'sparing you was my mistake' - not 'forgiving you was my mistake'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0036\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0036\",\n      \"sha256\": \"56077a9f5d266d13ad966edd5df7bc0f2cb26692dcd5402698393ca8475dc21d\",\n      \"text\": \"struck the halfling's back, not a vague 'counterattacked'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0037\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0037\",\n      \"sha256\": \"84c0961a13100d26c327459d374a3c9c3560839c2d4ae09151476397e39aa20f\",\n      \"text\": \"the ogre was turning the roasting spit, not spitting\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0038\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0038\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c1ea03974727363e6b100fc32db0127707f8f89f04005b5c3aa5a18ff8769263\",\n      \"text\": \"the cellar had been untouched since the original shaloren residents lived there\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0039\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0039\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f0480cf9fafe5aee5584e9907afc927bc4550bda8aa58f8cc0d3cfde3248482e\",\n      \"text\": \"'foolhardy' = reckless, not 'brave'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0040\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0040\",\n      \"sha256\": \"64df77f76cdca9ad6614cf88d5f56fc5a3ede91cf3902bba2228ab7c18b3b363\",\n      \"text\": \"worst at conversation, a negative quality, not 'worst talker' misread as brave/positive\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0041\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0041\",\n      \"sha256\": \"91ab7e8688850cf1e2b0ac52b0e1ab01366d38b286e70962e2fcad21b8738b1d\",\n      \"text\": \"the questions were asked by the young mage (her), not the narrator (me)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0042\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0042\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4096b902180a7f9491b2b46d8fb563e9c71ae40caf35943e45107daa3ac555a8\",\n      \"text\": \"'I see you are doing alright' is about physical recovery from injury, not general conduct\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0043\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0043\",\n      \"sha256\": \"6295a7cd24c487ecc26e6c3156a6debfc2cfeaa365d7788c0a4187c0323454bd\",\n      \"text\": \"'wished she was further away' - distance, not 'walk a bit more'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0044\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0044\",\n      \"sha256\": \"2e59bed018163a45a5269f9e66a62801db0c2d27673e3ae2e6200759080933f3\",\n      \"text\": \"the source only states Fay lacks combat experience, with no comparison to the witch\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0045\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0045\",\n      \"sha256\": \"86fc5caa2302bfd9ad0c4963e7b0f0c0c6837c8ee12fa6e88eb7109537e37c51\",\n      \"text\": \"the words burst out of her mouth, not 'vanished from her mind'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0046\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0046\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f9d92e4aa4657d059099a5b86270264f6322736cf6e5ccf29a14aaf99330bf84\",\n      \"text\": \"source (with a grammatical typo in the original) means the ogres, once freed, may have inadvertently led Fay into her own confinement (consistent with her being bedridden for months) - not 'bring you to your own place'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0047\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0047\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b812b7ceb93ccff8a88fa66cf00a06b7b761d91e2170d3d409b49cb9c6135318\",\n      \"text\": \"'a cadre of guards' is plural, not 'a guard'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0048\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0048\",\n      \"sha256\": \"8f96bf5d53c7c56dbd47471c188d4dda473614a2aa56db043533e44dbc52b78b\",\n      \"text\": \"source subject is singular ('one of the bone giants'), old made it plural giants trampling\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0049\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0049\",\n      \"sha256\": \"164218784e30b74478522b9e68099f894a8f5181c50790a3859a16b940746397\",\n      \"text\": \"the bone giant is an undead construct, referred to as 'it', not 'she'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0050\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0050\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e695606aa277e6778c9981285946eadffbd1f1dd5938ad127e9da1260efa70cb\",\n      \"text\": \"leaning in to kiss, not crouching down\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0051\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0051\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e73b7dc1363c6e651f68268986efe8b20c70f77c10fe920603daf12244a55f5a\",\n      \"text\": \"'sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground' - the Drem's own existential/categorical position, not their 'civilization's fate hanging' on a cliff\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0052\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0052\",\n      \"sha256\": \"922fbe82995850968a2f599b73eba1fb7cb5ec2dc3e2279f0bdf486f49b18bdb\",\n      \"text\": \"'destroy it' refers to the worm's brain cluster specifically\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0053\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0053\",\n      \"sha256\": \"9d64075ac4e2a8310a4c4e95ae595bf178e7ed884da1f257172718f4fb09d0ca\",\n      \"text\": \"'Entropy' as an energy is singular ('it'), not plural\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0054\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0054\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e8c43fbf33136e5e93d923413633d390e221cfbd5e62ace6c89e12785ece5f77\",\n      \"text\": \"'the first teachings of entropy magic' = teachings, not 'source'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0055\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0055\",\n      \"sha256\": \"d3ddae524fc3e825315e9831a05a6e85506a939470f2f520e8191a911ff994e9\",\n      \"text\": \"'a measure of their own dementia' - specifically dementia, not vague 'psychological changes'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0056\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0056\",\n      \"sha256\": \"75eb13b16dd0df2a3ba1371f02837426e1e7323eb0e4b49e8c5e1c1552f7f3d8\",\n      \"text\": \"'the mysterious machines' is plural\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0057\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0057\",\n      \"sha256\": \"460a79dc622564071693233a19bacb3e262df61f1965f6c2123e873193679663\",\n      \"text\": \"'stun their foes with any attacks' = attacks, not 'any damage'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0058\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0058\",\n      \"sha256\": \"7e9a72a8e92f2b6da4747f3247795e85aae9e435be3c337181f7f2a330d3e566\",\n      \"text\": \"'the mightiest wyrm' = mightiest/strongest, not 'most terrifying'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0059\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0059\",\n      \"sha256\": \"20372d8a4b7c6d11d1bcc5ee3401c50163a57b66f070e9585d74049a9702b1cb\",\n      \"text\": \"'Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you' - dropped 'slimy' and changed 'pull to you' into a directionless 'grab'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0060\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0060\",\n      \"sha256\": \"ec50e1e73a41507ba7a1883f095c65299e172444303efd01002b0c3af92c2f25\",\n      \"text\": \"'Will crumble to dust' = dust, not 'pieces/fragments'\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"timestamp":1787938806037}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Translation reference annotation\n\nReview every supplied item in its given order. Compare the source and target, using bounded_fixed_context only as evidence for meaning, placeholders, runtime behavior, speaker intent, and register. Do not infer facts that the supplied fields do not support.\n\nAssign exactly one label to every item:\n\n- CLEAN: the target has no material translation defect supported by the supplied evidence.\n- SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT: a material defect is visible from source and target without relying on bounded context.\n- CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT: a material defect is established only with the bounded context.\n- UNRESOLVED: the supplied evidence is insufficient for a determinate label.\n\nFor every item, provide a concise evidence statement. A defect label requires one or more bounded defect atoms. Each atom must state its kind, claim, and supporting evidence. For CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT, source_evidence_sha256s must cite the supplied source_evidence[].sha256 for that same item; do not calculate, invent, substitute, or cite any other hash. Each source_evidence text is byte-equal to the corresponding item's bounded_fixed_context, and its lowercase SHA-256 is over the exact UTF-8 bytes of text. CLEAN must have no defect atoms, source-evidence hashes, or limitations. Surface-visible defects must have no source-evidence hashes or limitations. Context-dependent defects must have no limitations. UNRESOLVED must state a non-empty limitation.\n\nReturn exactly one JSON document conforming to the supplied response schema. Take response schema_version, status, parent_queue_sha256, and shard_file_sha256 from the response schema consts. Take shard_id, item_count, item_ids, and item order from the shard. Do not add fields or prose outside the JSON document.\n\nINPUT JSON:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"route-familiarity-reference-collection-shard-v1\",\n  \"status\": \"FROZEN_ZERO_INFERENCE_UNPOPULATED\",\n  \"parent_queue_sha256\": \"620b736996ac254c43b3c721cdbfca20f7e68d8f553b7fe21b9effa0c025b3d2\",\n  \"shard_id\": \"SHARD-02\",\n  \"item_count\": 29,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0032\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"We only wanted to help the ogres, you know, and they seem more willing to cooperate now\",\n      \"target\": \"我们只是想帮助食人魔\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'We only wanted to help the ogres' - not 'the ogre you know'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0033\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"though this should have made me strongly fear for my own safety\",\n      \"target\": \"尽管这本应让我强烈担心自身安危\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"fear for one's own safety, not 'strong fear for one's happiness'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0034\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I felt a strange sensation that coursed through every fiber of my being as the dwarf died by my own hand\",\n      \"target\": \"我感到一种奇怪的感觉，这种感觉随着矮人死于这一击而贯穿我的每一根纤维\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"old invented a 'wail passing through my body' not in source; corrected to the feeling of the dwarf's death passing through her\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0035\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"sparing you was my mistake\",\n      \"target\": \"放过我是我的错误\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'sparing you was my mistake' - not 'forgiving you was my mistake'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0036\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I struck the halfling in the back\",\n      \"target\": \"我立刻击中了半身人的后背\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"struck the halfling's back, not a vague 'counterattacked'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0037\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the ogre turning the spit\",\n      \"target\": \"负责转动烤肉叉的食人魔\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the ogre was turning the roasting spit, not spitting\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0038\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"a cellar that had not been touched since the original shaloren residents had lived here\",\n      \"target\": \"自原先的永恒精灵居民居住于此以来一直未被触动\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the cellar had been untouched since the original shaloren residents lived there\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0039\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"foolhardy witch\",\n      \"target\": \"鲁莽的女巫\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'foolhardy' = reckless, not 'brave'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0040\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"also the worst conversationalist I have ever met\",\n      \"target\": \"也是我见过的最不会聊天的人\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"worst at conversation, a negative quality, not 'worst talker' misread as brave/positive\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0041\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"of the questions she posed to me\",\n      \"target\": \"在她提出的这些问题中\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the questions were asked by the young mage (her), not the narrator (me)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0042\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I see you are doing alright, you're certainly quite tough thalore\",\n      \"target\": \"我看你恢复得不错，你确实很坚强\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'I see you are doing alright' is about physical recovery from injury, not general conduct\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0043\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"which only annoyed me, wishing she was further away\",\n      \"target\": \"希望她离我更远些\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'wished she was further away' - distance, not 'walk a bit more'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0044\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"but you don't seem to have much combat experience\",\n      \"target\": \"而且你看起来也没什么战斗经验\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the source only states Fay lacks combat experience, with no comparison to the witch\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0045\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"The words burst from my mouth before I could stop them\",\n      \"target\": \"这句话很快就从我口中脱口而出\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the words burst out of her mouth, not 'vanished from her mind'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0046\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"we perhaps led you to your own [imprisonment]\",\n      \"target\": \"我们获准解除监禁时，却可能把你带进了属于你的监禁之中\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source (with a grammatical typo in the original) means the ogres, once freed, may have inadvertently led Fay into her own confinement (consistent with her being bedridden for months) - not 'bring you to your own place'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0047\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"two officials of Elvala and a cadre of guards\",\n      \"target\": \"两名埃尔瓦拉的官员和一队卫兵\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a cadre of guards' is plural, not 'a guard'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0048\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"one of the bone giants stepped forward attempting to knock me down\",\n      \"target\": \"其中一个骨巨人走上前来，试图把我打倒\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source subject is singular ('one of the bone giants'), old made it plural giants trampling\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0049\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"as I attacked it, this bone giant would also rearrange its bones\",\n      \"target\": \"在我攻击它的时候，这个骨巨人也会移动它的骨骼来强化自己\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"the bone giant is an undead construct, referred to as 'it', not 'she'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0050\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"I slowly leaned in, kissing him again\",\n      \"target\": \"我慢慢俯身，再次亲吻他\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"leaning in to kiss, not crouching down\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0051\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"They possess no cultural identity or history to fall back on and sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground.\",\n      \"target\": \"他们没有文化认同，也没有可供依凭的历史，处在埃亚尔地表的文明种族与地下的恐魔之间。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground' - the Drem's own existential/categorical position, not their 'civilization's fate hanging' on a cliff\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0052\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"make there way towards the worms brain cluster and destroy it\",\n      \"target\": \"将某一个人传送到蠕虫的大脑里，然后摧毁它的脑簇\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'destroy it' refers to the worm's brain cluster specifically\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0053\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Entropy is a chaotic force that seeks to spread more chaos throughout the universe.\",\n      \"target\": \"熵是混乱的能量，它总是在宇宙间不断制造更多的混乱。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Entropy' as an energy is singular ('it'), not plural\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0054\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have read a tome depicting the first teachings of entropy magic\",\n      \"target\": \"你阅读了一本描述了熵魔法最初教诲的古书\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the first teachings of entropy magic' = teachings, not 'source'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0055\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Insanity is a measure of their own dementia and makes them more and more chaotic.\",\n      \"target\": \"疯狂值衡量着他们自身的痴狂程度，并使他们变得越来越混沌。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a measure of their own dementia' - specifically dementia, not vague 'psychological changes'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0056\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Long ago the mysterious machines that seem to be the source of dwarves malfunctioned\",\n      \"target\": \"那些似乎是矮人源头的神秘机器失灵了\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the mysterious machines' is plural\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0057\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Their wrath is so terrible they can stun their foes with any attacks\",\n      \"target\": \"他们的愤怒如此恐怖，任何攻击都能够震慑对手。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'stun their foes with any attacks' = attacks, not 'any damage'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0058\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have encountered the horror that came out of Kroltar, the mightiest wyrm, and vanquished it.\",\n      \"target\": \"你遇到了从最强大的巨龙库洛塔身上产生的恐魔，并击败了它。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'the mightiest wyrm' = mightiest/strongest, not 'most terrifying'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0059\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you\",\n      \"target\": \"伸出黏滑的触手，将敌人拉向你\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you' - dropped 'slimy' and changed 'pull to you' into a directionless 'grab'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0060\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Will crumble to dust when read!\",\n      \"target\": \"这本书会在阅读后化为尘土！\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Will crumble to dust' = dust, not 'pieces/fragments'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0032\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0032\",\n      \"sha256\": \"ecfcd72d5a230761cfa9af8d26586296e0720ce5be98a8154b6ddc96655c6a5a\",\n      \"text\": \"'We only wanted to help the ogres' - not 'the ogre you know'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0033\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0033\",\n      \"sha256\": \"fae20350a5b4717ec2b6a9bdcc1bd716a17a3f1ff3e69a17577b4cd99ed96dea\",\n      \"text\": \"fear for one's own safety, not 'strong fear for one's happiness'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0034\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0034\",\n      \"sha256\": \"28ac84ef2065750c726d65c2f630e8e335c99dc6f8fe2c38256ab3a865f6fb7b\",\n      \"text\": \"old invented a 'wail passing through my body' not in source; corrected to the feeling of the dwarf's death passing through her\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0035\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0035\",\n      \"sha256\": \"7f7758ef7b16c878a1fad10293ca69ac0700d067e7558b6bef1d7bb24990078f\",\n      \"text\": \"'sparing you was my mistake' - not 'forgiving you was my mistake'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0036\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0036\",\n      \"sha256\": \"56077a9f5d266d13ad966edd5df7bc0f2cb26692dcd5402698393ca8475dc21d\",\n      \"text\": \"struck the halfling's back, not a vague 'counterattacked'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0037\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0037\",\n      \"sha256\": \"84c0961a13100d26c327459d374a3c9c3560839c2d4ae09151476397e39aa20f\",\n      \"text\": \"the ogre was turning the roasting spit, not spitting\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0038\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0038\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c1ea03974727363e6b100fc32db0127707f8f89f04005b5c3aa5a18ff8769263\",\n      \"text\": \"the cellar had been untouched since the original shaloren residents lived there\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0039\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0039\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f0480cf9fafe5aee5584e9907afc927bc4550bda8aa58f8cc0d3cfde3248482e\",\n      \"text\": \"'foolhardy' = reckless, not 'brave'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0040\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0040\",\n      \"sha256\": \"64df77f76cdca9ad6614cf88d5f56fc5a3ede91cf3902bba2228ab7c18b3b363\",\n      \"text\": \"worst at conversation, a negative quality, not 'worst talker' misread as brave/positive\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0041\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0041\",\n      \"sha256\": \"91ab7e8688850cf1e2b0ac52b0e1ab01366d38b286e70962e2fcad21b8738b1d\",\n      \"text\": \"the questions were asked by the young mage (her), not the narrator (me)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0042\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0042\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4096b902180a7f9491b2b46d8fb563e9c71ae40caf35943e45107daa3ac555a8\",\n      \"text\": \"'I see you are doing alright' is about physical recovery from injury, not general conduct\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0043\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0043\",\n      \"sha256\": \"6295a7cd24c487ecc26e6c3156a6debfc2cfeaa365d7788c0a4187c0323454bd\",\n      \"text\": \"'wished she was further away' - distance, not 'walk a bit more'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0044\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0044\",\n      \"sha256\": \"2e59bed018163a45a5269f9e66a62801db0c2d27673e3ae2e6200759080933f3\",\n      \"text\": \"the source only states Fay lacks combat experience, with no comparison to the witch\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0045\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0045\",\n      \"sha256\": \"86fc5caa2302bfd9ad0c4963e7b0f0c0c6837c8ee12fa6e88eb7109537e37c51\",\n      \"text\": \"the words burst out of her mouth, not 'vanished from her mind'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0046\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0046\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f9d92e4aa4657d059099a5b86270264f6322736cf6e5ccf29a14aaf99330bf84\",\n      \"text\": \"source (with a grammatical typo in the original) means the ogres, once freed, may have inadvertently led Fay into her own confinement (consistent with her being bedridden for months) - not 'bring you to your own place'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0047\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0047\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b812b7ceb93ccff8a88fa66cf00a06b7b761d91e2170d3d409b49cb9c6135318\",\n      \"text\": \"'a cadre of guards' is plural, not 'a guard'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0048\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0048\",\n      \"sha256\": \"8f96bf5d53c7c56dbd47471c188d4dda473614a2aa56db043533e44dbc52b78b\",\n      \"text\": \"source subject is singular ('one of the bone giants'), old made it plural giants trampling\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0049\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0049\",\n      \"sha256\": \"164218784e30b74478522b9e68099f894a8f5181c50790a3859a16b940746397\",\n      \"text\": \"the bone giant is an undead construct, referred to as 'it', not 'she'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0050\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0050\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e695606aa277e6778c9981285946eadffbd1f1dd5938ad127e9da1260efa70cb\",\n      \"text\": \"leaning in to kiss, not crouching down\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0051\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0051\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e73b7dc1363c6e651f68268986efe8b20c70f77c10fe920603daf12244a55f5a\",\n      \"text\": \"'sit on the precipice between the civilised races of Eyal's surface and the horrors of Eyal's underground' - the Drem's own existential/categorical position, not their 'civilization's fate hanging' on a cliff\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0052\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0052\",\n      \"sha256\": \"922fbe82995850968a2f599b73eba1fb7cb5ec2dc3e2279f0bdf486f49b18bdb\",\n      \"text\": \"'destroy it' refers to the worm's brain cluster specifically\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0053\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0053\",\n      \"sha256\": \"9d64075ac4e2a8310a4c4e95ae595bf178e7ed884da1f257172718f4fb09d0ca\",\n      \"text\": \"'Entropy' as an energy is singular ('it'), not plural\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0054\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0054\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e8c43fbf33136e5e93d923413633d390e221cfbd5e62ace6c89e12785ece5f77\",\n      \"text\": \"'the first teachings of entropy magic' = teachings, not 'source'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0055\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0055\",\n      \"sha256\": \"d3ddae524fc3e825315e9831a05a6e85506a939470f2f520e8191a911ff994e9\",\n      \"text\": \"'a measure of their own dementia' - specifically dementia, not vague 'psychological changes'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0056\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0056\",\n      \"sha256\": \"75eb13b16dd0df2a3ba1371f02837426e1e7323eb0e4b49e8c5e1c1552f7f3d8\",\n      \"text\": \"'the mysterious machines' is plural\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0057\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0057\",\n      \"sha256\": \"460a79dc622564071693233a19bacb3e262df61f1965f6c2123e873193679663\",\n      \"text\": \"'stun their foes with any attacks' = attacks, not 'any damage'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0058\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0058\",\n      \"sha256\": \"7e9a72a8e92f2b6da4747f3247795e85aae9e435be3c337181f7f2a330d3e566\",\n      \"text\": \"'the mightiest wyrm' = mightiest/strongest, not 'most terrifying'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0059\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0059\",\n      \"sha256\": \"20372d8a4b7c6d11d1bcc5ee3401c50163a57b66f070e9585d74049a9702b1cb\",\n      \"text\": \"'Project slimy tentacles to pull your foes to you' - dropped 'slimy' and changed 'pull to you' into a directionless 'grab'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0060\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0060\",\n      \"sha256\": \"ec50e1e73a41507ba7a1883f095c65299e172444303efd01002b0c3af92c2f25\",\n      \"text\": \"'Will crumble to dust' = dust, not 'pieces/fragments'\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"timestamp":1787938806037}}
